# Cleanup temporary artifacts

When the task is done (or abandoned), remove one-off files created only for investigation, DB probing, E2E harnesses, screenshots, or local run logs.

## Do delete after the task
- Ad-hoc helpers under `/_scratch/`, `/.agent-tmp/`, `/tmp-agent/`
- Root runtime logs: `be-run.log`, `be-test-run.log`, `*-run.log`
- Password-reset / credential probe scripts not part of the product

## Do keep (commit when the user asks)
- Real product code under `src/`
- Migrations/seeds under `src/main/resources/db/migration/`
- Intentional tracked scripts (`scripts/postgres/`, `scripts/load_test_tenant.sh`)
- `.gitignore` updates that prevent reintroducing junk

## Practice
1. Prefer ignored scratch paths for throwaway work.
2. Before marking complete, delete throwaways so `git status` shows only meaningful source changes.
3. Do not commit secrets or connection passwords in scripts.
